        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Foundation row" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Chain a multiple of 8 plus 2. Row 1: dc in each ch to end. Turn." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Leaf row" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Row 2: *ch 3, skip 2 dc, dc in next dc. Row 3: working into the ch-3 arcs: 2 tr, 3 tr, 2 tr (7 tr leaf base across one arc), dc into the dc anchor. Continue this arc-then-leaf sequence across." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Leaf tip row" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Row 4: work decreasing trebles over each 7-tr leaf base (tr2tog, tr, tr2tog), picot at the central treble tip. Fasten off. Sew the foundation edge to your fabric with the tapestry needle and weave in the ends." }]
      }
    ]
  }
